# An allowlist: everything stays out of the build context unless it is named below. The working tree
# holds files git ignores and an image must never carry -- appsettings.Development.json, the Function's
# local.settings.json, saved Playwright sign-ins (live sessions), local agent notes -- and a denylist
# would have to know every one of them in advance.
*

!global.json
!backend/Directory.Build.props
!backend/Directory.Packages.props
!backend/src/
!frontend/

# Inside what came back in: build output, local configuration and test artefacts stay out.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/local.settings.json
# .env files are local secrets by .gitignore's own rule; `!frontend/` would bring a Vite .env.local back
# into the SPA stage (measured 2026-09-25 with a canary file: it was there).
**/.env
**/.env.*
backend/src/AzureBank.Functions.NoticeRelay/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/e2e/.auth/
frontend/screenshots/.auth/
frontend/screenshots/output/
